{"id":"4e2702c4e2ad5bc9","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-cor-abs.md","title":"Absoluteness Corollary","display":"cor-abs — Absoluteness Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-abs","aliases":["58-cor-abs"],"display":"cor-abs — Absoluteness Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","[[58-df-assignment]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md]]","[[58-thm-absoluteness-calculation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-abs"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-abs</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-abs — Absoluteness Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"58-df-assignment\">58-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2678ecfefaa83e32\" href=\"?note=2678ecfefaa83e32\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7d6da4bef6932415\" href=\"?note=7d6da4bef6932415\" title=\"58-thm-absoluteness-calculation\">58-thm-absoluteness-calculation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"2678ecfefaa83e32\" href=\"?note=2678ecfefaa83e32\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in V\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\">\\(M,N\\in V\\setminus\\{\\emptyset\\}\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M),\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(N)\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M),\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(N)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_M\\coloneqq\\langle M,\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in M\\times M:x\\in y\\}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal M_M\\coloneqq\\langle M,\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in M\\times M:x\\in y\\}\\rangle\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_N\\coloneqq\\langle N,\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in N\\times N:x\\in y\\}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal M_N\\coloneqq\\langle N,\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in N\\times N:x\\in y\\}\\rangle\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in V\">\\(s\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_M,s)\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_M,s)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"58-df-assignment\">58-df-assignment</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\)</span> 为所引语言文件的成员语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal M_N\">\\(\\mathcal M_M,\\mathcal M_N\\)</span> 随正文中量化的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\">\\(M,N\\)</span> 按上述公式取值。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}abs} \\vdash \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\to\\forall M,N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(M\\ne\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(N)\\land M\\subseteq N\\to\\forall s\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_M,s)\\to(\\mathcal M_M\\models\\varphi[s]\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal M_N\\models\\varphi[s])\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}abs} \\vdash \\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\mathcal L_\\in)\\to\\forall M,N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(M\\ne\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(N)\\land M\\subseteq N\\to\\forall s\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M_M,s)\\to(\\mathcal M_M\\models\\varphi[s]\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal M_N\\models\\varphi[s])\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> formulas are absolute between nonempty transitive sets when all parameters are assigned inside the smaller set; neither set must satisfy all of ZF.</li>\n<li>Many fundamental set-theoretic facts are absolute.</li>\n<li>The bounded-formula predicate is applied with its required signature argument; the former unary call was a signature drift.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md","status":"resolved","id":"3888033a846b1cd5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"2678ecfefaa83e32","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-thm-absoluteness-calculation","status":"resolved","id":"7d6da4bef6932415","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-thm-absoluteness-calculation]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S:V\\to V$ and $\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"2678ecfefaa83e32","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $\\mathrm{DeltaZeroFormula}_S(\\varphi,\\mathcal L_\\in)$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-delta-zero-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"64f